WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Acceptance.

2
00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:03.750
Acceptance for all of you.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.500
So there’s so many different aspects of me,

4
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.850
and if you focus on one part, you miss the other.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.200
But I can still have an incredible life.

6
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.600
I can still empower and create spaces
where other people feel like they belong.

7
00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:24.300
You belong simply because you exist.

